{"code":"BL13","wikidata":"Q13021858","wikipedia":{"en":"Hua Lamphong MRT station","th":"สถานีหัวลำโพง"},"summary":{"en":"Hua Lamphong station is a rapid transit station on the Blue Line of the Bangkok MRT in Thailand. It is located underground on Rama IV Road in front of Bangkok (Hua Lamphong) railway station, more commonly known as Hua Lamphong railway station. It is the first station of Paknam Railway, the first railway line in Thailand, as well as the former central station.","th":"สถานีหัวลำโพง เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าใต้ดิน ในเส้นทางรถไฟฟ้ามหานคร สายเฉลิมรัชมงคล ที่ถนนพระรามที่ 4 กรุงเทพมหานคร บริเวณสถานีกรุงเทพ (หัวลำโพง) สถานีรถไฟหลักของประเทศไทย ในอนาคตสถานีจะเชื่อมต่อกับโครงการรถไฟฟ้าชานเมือง สายสีแดงเข้มบริเวณสถานีกรุงเทพ (หัวลำโพง)"},"opened":"2004-07-03","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Hua_Lampong_MRT_station.jpg/960px-Hua_Lampong_MRT_station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hua_Lampong_MRT_station.jpg","author":"Ilya Plekhanov","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8b/201701_Channel_from_BKK_to_HUA.jpg/960px-201701_Channel_from_BKK_to_HUA.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:201701_Channel_from_BKK_to_HUA.jpg","author":"MNXANL","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/201701_Concourse_of_Hua_Lamphong_Station.jpg/960px-201701_Concourse_of_Hua_Lamphong_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:201701_Concourse_of_Hua_Lamphong_Station.jpg","author":"MNXANL","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/201701_Exhibiting_area_at_HUA.jpg/960px-201701_Exhibiting_area_at_HUA.jpg?utm_source=c